# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. Skipping the reconcile when
# the shard map changed mid-export is safe only if the re-bootstrap is requested again;
# otherwise r keeps the deleted value.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceReshardSkipNotRetried
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a re-bootstrap whose reconcile a reshard skipped is not repeated, so the reaped delete is never reconciled
PERTURBS: EndExport

--- FIND
    /\ booted' = (booted \/ (ex.phase = "full" /\ topo = ex.topo0))
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the re-bootstrap completes whether or not the reconcile ran.
    /\ booted' = (booted \/ ex.phase = "full")
--- END
